##############################################################
# EventType: 2430842000
# Descriptor: [gamma gamma -> omega [ ->  pi+ pi- pi0 ] Jpsi [ -> e+ e- / mu+ mu- ]] are generated via two photon process
# NickName: diphoton_omegajpsi
# Test : Yes
# Documentation: MC16rd signal request
# PhysicsWG: Quarkonium
# Responsible: Shiqing Xie
# Email: sqxie22@m.fudan.edu.cn
# Cuts: None
# Date: 2026/10/19
#
# Decay table to generate
# gamma gamma ->   omega -> pi+ pi- pi0
#                  J/psi 
#                  |
#                  -> e+ e-
#                  -> mu+ mu- 
#                     
###############################################################

Decay J/psi
0.5  e+  e-                                       VLL;
0.5  mu+  mu-                                     VLL;
Enddecay

Decay omega
1.0   pi+ pi- pi0 PHOTOS OMEGA_DALITZ;
Enddecay

Decay pi0
1.0   gamma  gamma                                 PHSP;
Enddecay

End

